          "title": "Promo pics potential source",
          "url": "https://jessm78.livejournal.com",
          "description": "The wiki links this livejournal account as the source of information for the pictures. I did look around a bit (not exhaustively) and I think is likely the refered pictures where originally posted by Andreas_ri ( https://andreas-ri.livejournal.com/profile/ ), that had a website with supernatural media called Spnmedia.net. This site was also referrenced on the Dean_Sam community ( https://dean-sam.livejournal.com/profile/ ) when I tried to find the images. Most image links are lost."
