    {
      "id": "event-002949028339",
      "type": "event",
      "title": "TV.com Q&A: Supernatural creator Eric Kripke",
      "date": 2008.024193548387,
      "groupId": "g-3",
      "parents": [],
      "eventLineStyle": "solid",
      "eventBorderStyle": "solid",
      "dateLabel": "2008-01-10",
      "tags": [
        "Interview",
        "Erik Kripke"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "TV.com Q&A with Erik Kripke",
          "url": "https://agt-spooky.dreamwidth.org/262679.html#cutid1",
          "description": "The link to the interview seems to no longer exists. It was however archived by agt_spooky on livejournal (assuming the interviews were not edited, for which I do not think there is a reason). The interview was originally posted at https://agt-spooky.livejournal.com/259745.html?es=1 before the author archived and moved their Livejournal to Dreamwidth (atttached link). \n\nThis account seems to have archived many interviews about the series from an early time. She seems to go by the nom de plume Jamie Lynn Miller. Was a wincestie (potentially no longer in the fandom)."
        }
      ],
      "noteFile": "event-002949028339.md",
      "color": "#B33E52"
    },
    {
      "id": "event-000219660084",
      "type": "event",
      "title": "AXM Interview with Jensen Ackles and Jared Padalecki - Supernatural Sex Appeal",
      "date": 2006.5833333333333,
      "groupId": "g-3",
      "parents": [],
      "eventLineStyle": "solid",
      "eventBorderStyle": "solid",
      "dateLabel": "2006-08-01",
      "color": "#B33E52",
      "approximate": true,
      "noteFile": "event-000219660084.md",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Interview transcript and pictures",
          "url": "https://jensendaily.org/eng/2006/08/01/supernatural-sex-appeal/",
          "description": "The interview seems to have been trascribed the day it was published. It is assumed no editing of the original took place.\n\nThe interview was also punblished by agt_spooky ( https://agt-spooky.dreamwidth.org/643634.html#comments on dreamwidth and https://agt-spooky.livejournal.com/672884.html on livejournal). The images included in the magazine seem to be promo pictures from S.1   (as archived) . We can see the same pictures or similar ones archived here:\n\nFirst image - https://travellerintime.tumblr.com/post/647735101815390208/supernatural-season-1-promo-photos-hq (4th picture). Archived by TravellerInTime. \nSecond image - https://www.tumblr.com/travellerintime/645553663907151872/supernatural-season-1-promo-photos-hq (second image).Archived by TravellerInTime. \nThird image - https://www.tumblr.com/travellerintime/646654883279290368/supernatural-season-1-promo-photos-hq (first image).Archived by TravellerInTime."
        }
      ],
      "thumbnail": "AXM-Collage.png",
      "thumbnailStyle": "banner",
      "tags": [
        "Interview",
        "Jensen Ackles",
        "Jared Padalecki"
      ]
    },
