      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Filmobsessed137 post",
          "url": "I was sitting here, with the WB in the background, and they advertised that Sunday they will be airing the movie Sugar & Spice and at some point during the movie there will be a 4 minute preview of Supernatural. Just wanted to let everyone know so they can check it out.",
